<https://semantics.ericsson.com/yang/_3gpp-nr-nrm-gnbcucpfunction> a owl:Ontology ;
    rdfs:label "_3gpp-nr-nrm-gnbcucpfunction" ;
    dcterms:description """Defines the YANG mapping of the GNBCUCPFunction Information
Object Class (IOC) that is part of the NR Network Resource Model (NRM).
